'''Li'l Lion Cat''' (ちびネコライオン ''Chibi Neko Raion'', '''Chibi Lion Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy first found in [[Tiny Horns (Deadly)|Li'l Cow Awakens!]] He was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Li'l Lion Cat
|image = E 326.png
|appearance = [[Tiny Horns (Deadly)|Li'l Cow Awakens!]]
[[Path to +50|Li'l Cat's Trial]]
|money drop = 300¢ - 1,185¢
}}

==Enemy==
Like its slightly stronger counterpart, [[Manic Lion Cat (Enemy)|Manic Lion Cat]], Li'l Lion moves relatively fast, attacks fast, and appears in clusters. Its rapid attack speed and the fact that it is accompanied by other Li'l Lions makes it easy for this enemy to tear through your defenses, but it isn't made any harder than the Manic Lion Cat due to dealing single target damage and the availability of spammable rare attackers.

